NNOOTTEESS
       Hard  links,  as  created by lliinnkk(), cannot span filesystems.  Use ssyymm‐‐
       lliinnkk(2) if this is required.

BBUUGGSS
       On NFS filesystems, the return code may be wrong in case the NFS server
       performs the link creation and dies before it can say so.  Use  ssttaatt(2)
       to find out if the link got created.

